  title: Repurposing Weapons
  image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: b11f9c52da2945740b5078d84177a9ab, type: 3}
  eventDescription: You find a stash of weapons, some in great quality, others in
    not so much. Maybe you could pilfer one to improve your weaponry?
  randomCardsAvailable: 5
  conditions:
  - _requirementString: Cads without element will benefit from a new weapon;
    _successString: Due to wielding a card without element, it will be gain more
      from a new weapon.
    _failString: The card used had an element.
    _filter:
      rid: 5880775371356110876
  - _requirementString: Attack cards will gain more from this.
    _successString: The card was an attack one, gaining more from this quest.
    _failString: The card was not an attack one.
    _filter:
      rid: 5880775371356110884
  - _requirementString: Cards that deal low damage will have more benefit due to
      training.
    _successString: The card low damage means there was more room for improvement.
    _failString: The card either did no damage, or too much damage.
    _filter:
      rid: 5880775371356110885
  - _requirementString: Legendary cards would not benefit too much from scrappy weapons
    _successString: The low rarity of the card gave it more room for improvement
    _failString: The weapon barely held together before dissipating due to the card
      rarity.
    _filter:
      rid: 5880775371356110888
  questEnd: After sorting through them, you continue on your path upward.
  rewards:
